Factory Commander

{gold|Special Ability : Can cast Fortune spell at Expert Level.}

factory-creatures:faGunslinger.description:
{Gunslinger}

Unlike the Mechanics and Engineers, former members of Kastore's Project Outpost actually became better on Jadame. The Gunslingers got a rifle and a pistol instead of the old and archaic gun they had used to blend with other Outpost members, and practiced their shooting skills a lot.

{gold|Special Abilities : Shoots, Ranged First Retaliation.}

factory-creatures:faBounty.description:
