{gold|Special Abilities : Shoots, Unlimited Ranged First Retaliation.}

factory-creatures:faSheriff.description:
{Sheriff}

Unlike the Mechanics and Engineers, former members of Kastore's Project Outpost actually became better on Jadame. The Gunslingers got a rifle and a pistol instead of the old and archaic gun they had used to blend with other Outpost members, and practiced their shooting skills a lot. Sheriffs are the Gunslingers that were once bandits and bounty hunters, but now they are wery well paid by the government and serve the law.

{gold|Special Abilities : Shoots, Unlimited Ranged First Retaliation.}

factory-creatures:faCouatl.description:
{Rainbow Couatl}

The Couatls can be quite oftenly met on both Antagarich and Jadame. While Antagarich species has more serpentine features, the Jadamean ones are more bird-like. Despite the differences, both variations are immune to some negative effects.

{gold|Special Abilities : Flying, Immune to Stone Gaze, Poison, Bind, Disease, Paralyze, Age, Liches' Death Cloud, Thunderbirds' Thunderbolt, Dragonflies' Dispel, Death Stare and to the Acid Breath. Vulnerable to Slayer spell.}

