factory-creatures:faDreadnought.description:
{Steam Dreadnought}

The apex of the Factory technology. Despite not being powered by electricity, the Steam Dreadnoughts and Juggernauts use some Forge tech that Factory engineers could replicate. This powerful but costly combination results in big white beam.

{gold|Special Abilities : Non-Living, Wide Breath-like attack, vulnerable to Expert Slayer.}

